            "CMS announced theTransforming Maternal Health (TMaH) Modelin 2023. The model is a 10-year payment and care delivery model that aims to support participating state Medicaid agencies in developing and implementing a whole-person approach to pregnancy, childbirth, and postpartum care for women with Medicaid and CHIP coverage, including screening for and addressing health-related social needs.",
